{"slug":"roamsafe","title":"Roamsafe","desc":"Keep your employees connected anywhere in the UK with Roamsafe, automatically switching to the strongest network even in low-signal areas.","og":"https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/esim-image.png","content":"<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/hero {\"label\":\"eSIM\",\"title\":\"Roamsafe\",\"intro\":\"Get a signal anywhere to call for help\",\"buttons\":[{\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"dialog\":\"demo-dialog\",\"variant\":\"\"},{\"linkText\":\"Get a Quote\",\"link\":\"/uk/get-your-quote/\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"dialog\":\"\",\"variant\":\"outline\"}],\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/esim-image.png@@\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/trustpilot-widget {\"widget\":\"horizontal\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"title\":\"Low signal solution\",\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/iStock-519438087-scaled-e1732182687665-1024x638.jpg@@\",\"framed\":false,\"mediaPosition\":\"left\"} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Call for help, even in remote locations, buildings with poor signal, or areas with unreliable networks.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Roamsafe ensures you stay connected by automatically switching to the strongest available network, even in low-signal areas.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>By removing reliance on a single network provider, Roamsafe gives you access to the UK’s four major networks when using the <a href=\"/uk/products/lone-worker-app/\">Peoplesafe app</a>, keeping safety features active and workers protected no matter where they are.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"title\":\"Move to apps from devices\",\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/iStock-1384517648-1-1024x683.jpg@@\",\"framed\":false} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Using Roamsafe with the Peoplesafe app, you can experience the same connectivity as a <a href=\"/uk/lone-workers/\">lone worker device</a> with a roaming SIM.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Benefit from easier implementation and all the extra features the app provides (including <a href=\"/uk/products/travelsafe/\">Travelsafe</a>, discreet alarm and <a href=\"/uk/products/apple-watch/\">Apple Watch</a> integration) with the same assurance of reliable network signal.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Significantly reduce your upfront costs and ongoing maintenance expenses (lost or damaged devices) by opting for apps over devices.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"title\":\"How the eSIM works for the Peoplesafe App\",\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/iStock-1463992762-scaled-e1732183389140-1024x587.jpg@@\",\"framed\":false,\"mediaPosition\":\"left\"} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>An eSIM is a digital SIM card, which is built into most modern phones. We have configured this to work so that the Peoplesafe app can connect to any network, even when your primary SIM doesn’t have connection.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When the Peoplesafe app detects a low signal, it automatically switches to the backup eSIM, allowing employees to raise an alarm to the Peoplesafe <a href=\"/uk/alarm-receiving-centre/\">Alarm Receiving Centre (ARC)</a> at any time.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Give your employees the reassurance that they have access to assistance whenever and wherever they need it — even when their primary SIM loses connection.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"title\":\"Simple installation\",\"mediaType\":\"video\",\"videoUrl\":\"https://vimeo.com/1082879547\"} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Roamsafe is easy to deploy and scalable for large workforces. All modern smartphones have the ability to receive a Peoplesafe eSIM over the air removing the complexity of delivering to a dispersed workforce.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Assigning an eSIM to a mobile device is easy through the Nexus portal where you can manage activation as well as deactivation if necessary.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Enabling Roamsafe takes seconds via scanning a QR code which automatically provides employees with greater cellular coverage.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"title\":\"Download Brochure\",\"buttons\":[{\"linkText\":\"Download Product Brochure\",\"link\":\"https://insights.peoplesafe.co.uk/story/product-brochure/page/11/3/?teaser=yes\",\"linkTarget\":true,\"dialog\":\"\",\"variant\":\"outline\"}],\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/product-brochure-turtl.jpg@@\",\"framed\":false,\"mediaPosition\":\"left\"} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Want to learn more about how Roamsafe can enhance the safety and security of your workers in areas of low signal?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Download our comprehensive product brochure for detailed information on its features and benefits.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Discover how Roamsafe provides reliable protection and rapid response to ensure your employees are protected even when their primary SIM loses connectivity.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://insights.peoplesafe.co.uk/story/product-brochure/page/11/3/?teaser=yes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Download Product Brochure</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/faq {\"title\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\",\"faqs\":[{\"question\":\"What is an eSIM?\",\"answer\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eAn eSIM is a digital SIM card, which is built into most modern phones allowing users to activate a mobile network without needing a physical SIM card. We have configured this to work so that the Peoplesafe app can connect to any major network, even when your primary SIM doesn’t have a connection.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"question\":\"How does an eSIM work?\",\"answer\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eAn eSIM stores carrier information directly on your device, allowing it to connect to networks without needing a physical SIM card. This makes switching between providers easy and seamless.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eWith the Peoplesafe app, if your signal drops, the device automatically switches to a backup eSIM. This ensures you can always raise an alarm to the Peoplesafe Alarm Receiving Centre (ARC), keeping you connected and safe.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"question\":\"How to set up a Peoplesafe eSIM?\",\"answer\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eInstalling Roamsafe is quick and simple. Users will receive a QR code from Peoplesafe, once scanned this will automatically add the eSIM to their smartphone.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eManagers and administrators can easily assign an eSIM to a mobile device and manage its activation and deactivation through the Nexus portal.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"question\":\"What are the benefits of an eSIM?\",\"answer\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eeSIMs offer enhanced connectivity to the Peoplesafe service so you can raise an alarm in areas of poor signal. They also have a positive environmental impact by removing the production and disposal of physical SIM cards.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"question\":\"Why do I need an eSIM if I already have a SIM card in my phone?\",\"answer\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eYour primary SIM is tied to one network provider, which may not provide coverage in all areas. Roamsafe gives you access to all four major UK networks, automatically switching to the strongest available signal, helping maintain your connection with Peoplesafe.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"question\":\"Which phones support the Roamsafe eSIM?\",\"answer\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eMost newer iPhones and many Android devices support eSIMs. Check your phone’s specifications or look for an option to “Add Cellular Plan” in your phone’s cellular settings. Contact Peoplesafe if you’re unsure about your device’s compatibility.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"question\":\"Does Roamsafe affect other functions on my phone?\",\"answer\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eNo. Roamsafe operates in the background and does not interfere with other phone functions. It is dedicated to ensuring uninterrupted access to Peoplesafe.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"question\":\"Can I use Roamsafe for general calls and data?\",\"answer\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eNo. Roamsafe is designed exclusively for Peoplesafe services. It will only activate when your primary SIM loses signal and only for calls to Peoplesafe and use of the Peoplesafe app.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"question\":\"Is there anyway to check if a user has installed their Roamsafe eSIM?\",\"answer\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eYes, the Nexus portal provides a way to check if a user has installed their eSIM. The status will be displayed as “Activated” if the eSIM is installed and “Deactivated” if it’s uninstalled.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"},{\"question\":\"Can a Roamsafe eSIM be assigned to a different person?\",\"answer\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eYes, after an eSIM has been deleted from a person’s phone it can be assigned to a new user.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"}]} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/cta-banner {\"theme\":\"orange\",\"title\":\"See how it works\",\"content\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eTo get a Roamsafe demo with the Peoplesafe app, contact our experts using the form below.\\u003c/p\\u003e\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/form {\"formUrl\":\"https://safe.peoplesafe.co.uk/l/830213/2024-11-21/2kczfm\",\"height\":550} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/related-content {\"title\":\"Related Products\",\"items\":[{\"type\":\"product\",\"id\":\"@@prod:lone-worker-app@@\"},{\"type\":\"product\",\"id\":\"@@prod:sos-app@@\"},{\"type\":\"product\",\"id\":\"@@prod:travelsafe@@\"}]} /-->","menu_order":6,"types":["features","safety-apps"]}